<title>MEXICO: Kimberly approves stock split, div.</title>
<headline>Kimberly approves stock split, div.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kimberly Clark de Mexico SA (Kimber) said on Friday its shareholders had approved a five-for-one stock split and a dividend payment of 0.80 pesos.</p>
</text>
